### su2qc.ham.route_gausskernel.gauss_commutator_norms

**Signature** `gauss_commutator_norms(jmax)`
**Source** `runs/section8_v0.5.0_20260907T0628Z/src/su2qc/ham/route_gausskernel.py:390-407`
