### su2qc.ham.route_spinnet.validate_dimensions

**Signature** `validate_dimensions(jmax: float = 0.5) -> dict`
**Source** `runs/section8_v0.5.0_20260907T0628Z/src/su2qc/ham/route_spinnet.py:687-714`
